/*
 * tr.def - Turkish (system language 19). The ids are
 * strings_en.def's; an id left out shows the English. Notes for reviewers:
 * ../../TRANSLATIONS.md.
 *
 * In capitals Turkish turns i into İ, except in the names the drawing code
 * keeps as they are (Vita, Kill switch, Wi-Fi): draw.c.
 */

